      "te": "• English Explanation:\n• Total capacity =LCM(20,30,60)=60 units.\n• Efficiencies: X=+3, Y=+2, Z=-1.\n• Net efficiency =3+2-1=4 units/min.\n• Time to fill =(60)/(4)=15 minutes (Option B).\n• Exam Tip: Drain pipes are treated with negative efficiency."
