      "en": "• English Explanation:\n• Identity: a^(3)+b^(3)+c^(3)-3abc=(a+b+c)[(a+b+c)^(2)-3(ab+bc+ca)].\n• =11×[11^(2)-3(38)]=11×[121-114]=11×7=77 (Option B).\n• Exam Tip: Memorize the alternative form: (a+b+c)[(a+b+c)^(2)-3(ab+bc+ca)].",
      "te": "• English Explanation:\n• Identity: a^(3)+b^(3)+c^(3)-3abc=(a+b+c)[(a+b+c)^(2)-3(ab+bc+ca)].\n• =11×[11^(2)-3(38)]=11×[121-114]=11×7=77 (Option B).\n• Exam Tip: Memorize the alternative form: (a+b+c)[(a+b+c)^(2)-3(ab+bc+ca)]."
