      "en": "• English Explanation:\n• Given Series: 7, 11, 20, 36, 61, ?\n• Step 1 — Calculate First Differences:\n11-7=4\n20-11=9\n36-20=16\n61-36=25\n• Step 2 — Identify Pattern:\nThe differences are consecutive perfect squares: 2^(2),3^(2),4^(2),5^(2).\n• Step 3 — Next Difference:\n6^(2)=36.\n• Step 4 — Calculate Next Term:\n61+36=97 (Option B).\n• Exam Tip: Whenever differences are 4, 9, 16, 25, identify the square-series pattern immediately.",
      "te": "• తెలుగు వివరణ:\n• సంఖ్యల మధ్య తేడాలు: 4,9,16,25. ఇవి వరసగా 2^(2),3^(2),4^(2),5^(2).\n• తర్వాతి తేడా 6^(2)=36 అవుతుంది. కావున 61+36=97."
