      "en": "• English Explanation:\n• Four persons: P, Q, R, S.\n• Wings: Crime, Traffic, Special Branch, Cyber Cell.\n• Ranks: Inspector, SI, ASI, Head Constable.\n• P is in Crime (Rank ≠ Inspector).\n• Cyber Cell = ASI.\n• Inspector = Special Branch.\n• R is Sub-Inspector ⟹ R cannot be in Cyber Cell (ASI) or Special Branch (Inspector).\n• Also, P is in Crime ⟹ R cannot be in Crime!\n• Therefore, R must belong to Traffic! (Option A).\n• Exam Tip: Use negative deduction to eliminate impossible attribute combinations.",
